      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The kobold witch casts one of the following spells, using CHA as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15).<br>At will: disguise self, druidcraft, guidance<br>2/day each: command, ray of enfeeblement<br>1/day: bestow curse"
